<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ritwik's Realm</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0d0d0d;
            color: #f0f0f0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 40px;
            background: #161616;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #ff4d4d;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #b3b3b3;
        }
        .btn {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #ff4d4d;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #cc0000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.5);
        }
        #story-box {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px dashed #444;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .story-text {
            color: #d1d1d1;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Part 1: Secret Intro -->
        <div id="intro-box">
            <h1>Some doors are meant to stay closed...</h1>
            <p>But you just stepped into Ritwik's secret realm.</p>
            <p><em>Curiosity brought you here—let's see if you can handle the truth.</em> 🗝️👁️</p>
            
            <button class="btn" onclick="showStory()">Reveal My Story 📜</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Part 2: Hidden Story -->
        <div id="story-box">
            <h2 style="color: #ff4d4d; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Unfiltered Story</h2>
            
            <p class="story-text">
                Ek chote se gaav ka ek seedha-saadha ladka—<strong>Ritwik</strong>.
            </p>
            <p class="story-text">
                Uski zindagi ekdam shaant chal rahi thi, jab tak ki uska admission <strong>JNV Sehore</strong> me nahi ho gaya. Wahan kadam rakhte hi uski poori duniya hi badal gayi. 
            </p>
            <p class="story-text">
                Padhai se zyada usne hostel mein 'kaand' karne par dhyan diya. <strong>MK Pal sir</strong> se 8th class mein hi 20 rapte ki maar khayi, aur ek baar toh bhai daru piye hue bhi pakde gaye! 😅
            </p>
            <p class="story-text">
                Kitabi duniya se door, use zindagi ke asli rang dikh rahe the. Halanki, poori school life mein bhai kabhi ladkiyon se dhang se baat nahi kar paya—jiska use zyada dukh bhi nahi tha.
            </p>
            <p class="story-text">
                Par kismat ka twist dekho... <strong>12th ki shuruaat mein hi ek aisi ladki se mulaqat hui, jo dekhte hi dekhte uski favourite ban gayi!</strong> ✨
            </p>
            <p class="story-text" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
                <em>...Aur yahan se shuru hui asli kahani.</em> ⚡
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function showStory() {
            document.getElementById('story-box').style.display = 'block';
            event.target.style.display = 'none';
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
